Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:47.05,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 女单半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:47.05,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}高芙 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 贝莱克 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.93,EN,,0,0,0,,You're taking on Jessica tomorrow. One
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.13,0:00:00.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天你要迎战杰西卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of your best friends in the whole world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是你巡回赛上的挚友之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.33,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you two know how
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们当然都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:04.93,EN,,0,0,0,,to separate who's across the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.33,0:00:04.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,如何区分场下朋友和隔网对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:07.87,EN,,0,0,0,,But, a little bit of what's in store for all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:07.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,但先给我们透露一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.67,EN,,0,0,0,,of us tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:08.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天会有什么好戏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:09.73,EN,,0,0,0,,And by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.67,0:00:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:12.22,EN,,0,0,0,,three Americans in the finals tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:12.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天决赛里有三位美国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.30,EN,,0,0,0,,How cool is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,这有多酷？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. No, it's great to, you know, see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 美国网球现在状态真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.70,EN,,0,0,0,,the—you know—the men. I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看看男球员们 开个玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Can the men catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,男球员能追上来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.10,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:22.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.10,0:00:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.06,EN,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过说真的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.77,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,很显然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:27.59,EN,,0,0,0,,I think American tennis is in great hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:27.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得美国网球前景非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of great guys and girls—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们有很多优秀的男女球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,women—on both sides,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,两边都有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,they're all great people. And it was great
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且大家人都很好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.67,EN,,0,0,0,,to see Frances get to the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到蒂亚福打进决赛也很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:40.33,EN,,0,0,0,,He's someone I think that works so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.67,0:00:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得他一直非常努力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.67,EN,,0,0,0,,and definitely deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.33,0:00:41.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,绝对配得上这个结果
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And obviously Taylor, Brandon making it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗里茨和布兰登·中岛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:45.86,EN,,0,0,0,,in the quarters and semis, and Ben winning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.86,0:00:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,分别打进1/4决赛和半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.43,EN,,0,0,0,,in Montreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.86,0:00:46.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿则在蒙特利尔夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:47.86,EN,,0,0,0,,And that's not even speaking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.43,0:00:47.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,这还没开始说到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:48.71,EN,,0,0,0,,on the women.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.86,0:00:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,女球员这边呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously Jess and me in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.71,0:00:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,决赛里有杰西和我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.17,EN,,0,0,0,,Maddie, Amanda,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有麦迪逊和阿曼达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the list goes on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:54.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,名单真的太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.09,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's pretty incredible
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.52,0:00:56.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,厉害到我甚至
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:59.61,EN,,0,0,0,,that I cannot even remember all the names
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.09,0:00:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,都记不全此刻有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:01.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of how many successful Americans we have
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.61,0:01:01.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,表现出色的美国球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.33,EN,,0,0,0,,in this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.40,0:01:02.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,正处在聚光灯下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.27,EN,,0,0,0,,But, it's definitely great
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,能有这样一群优秀的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:05.37,EN,,0,0,0,,to be surrounded by a great group of peers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.27,0:01:05.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,围绕在身边真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think we all push each other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们彼此推动
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and root for each other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:08.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,也彼此为对方加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully you guys can root for Frances
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们明天也能为蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and I tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:14.68,EN,,0,0,0,,We'll try to make it a double.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.44,0:01:14.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们争取拿下双冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it'll be a double either way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.68,0:01:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,反正女单冠军肯定属于美国
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.00,EN,,0,0,0,,on the women's, but hopefully—I love Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.00,0:01:19.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过我爱杰西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, but maybe y'all can cheer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但明天你们或许也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.73,EN,,0,0,0,,for me too tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.64,0:01:21.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,给我多加加油
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:23.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But no, Jess is—and back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.73,0:01:23.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,说回来 杰西她……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:24.73,EN,,0,0,0,,to your original question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.64,0:01:24.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,回到你最初的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Jess is a great person, and she's one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.73,0:01:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,杰西真的是很好的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the people when I came on tour, one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.45,0:01:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚上巡回赛时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.50,EN,,0,0,0,,of the older players who was so nice to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.44,0:01:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,她作为资历更深的球员之一
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:32.73,EN,,0,0,0,,from the beginning and it's something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.50,0:01:32.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始就对我非常友善
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:33.97,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have such mad respect for her for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:33.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是我如此尊敬她的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.89,EN,,0,0,0,,And we had a tough match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:35.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们在温网打过一场苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.44,EN,,0,0,0,,at Wimbledon, and so I'm imagining
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.89,0:01:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我想明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.25,EN,,0,0,0,,it's going to be another tough match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.44,0:01:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,也会是一场艰难的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, they love you here in Cincinnati,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:41.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 辛辛那提的观众都爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:43.03,EN,,0,0,0,,the heart of tennis, and you've stolen all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:43.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是网球之心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:43.78,EN,,0,0,0,,of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.03,0:01:43.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你赢得了我们所有人的心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:47.05,EN,,0,0,0,,Coco Gauff, everybody. Let's hear it for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:47.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,掌声送给高芙
